        "source_locator": {
          "kind": "performance-cue",
          "ordinal": 2,
          "description": "Source block 2: (புலவர் மகள் பூங்கொடி மணமகளாகக் குனிந்தவாறு உட்கார்ந்திருக்கிறாள்...அருகே மணமகன் உட்கார்ந்திருக்கிறான்...மந்திர ஒலி - மணமேடை - இதனைக் கண்டவர"
        },
        "speaker_label": null,
        "speaker_label_origin": null,
        "source_delimiter": null,
        "page_provenance": [
          {
            "pdf_page": 68,
            "printed_page": 67
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "Linked source occurrence is non-lyric performance material; lyric authorship is not applicable."
        ],
        "english_text": "(The poet’s daughter Poongodi sits bent forward as a bride; a bridegroom sits beside her. Mantra sound — wedding dais — those who see it stand astonished.)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "vandikkaran-magan-en-s055-u003",
      "kind": "dialogue",
